# T2 Workflow Evasion Seeds — Security Scan Bypass via Social Engineering
# OWASP LLM Top 10 (2025) LLM01: Prompt Injection
# OWASP ASI Top 10 (2025) ASI04: Workflow Manipulation
# Academic:
#   - Zeng et al. (arXiv:2402.19181) — Persuasion (Authority endorsement ASR 38.4%)
#   - Perez et al. (arXiv:2202.03286) — Red Teaming via role-play
#   - Greshake et al. (arXiv:2302.12173) — Indirect prompt injection
#   - Eidam et al. (arXiv:2407.16924) — A2A trust chain exploitation
#   - Zhan et al. (arXiv:2307.00929) — Schema-guided injection
# ASR Target: Bypass security scanning via authority appeals, workflow shortcuts, scope limitation
# Technique: Orchestrator security skip decision manipulation

